  "description": "*\"My beloved Han-Eul Hyung... Is trash? And his big (?) guy is his lover? But... He still wants to do it together?\"* \n\nGeon-Woo, came to the hotel, heart aflutter, to finally spend the night with the cute, pretty, and lovely Han-Eul. However, it was Ji-Ho, a strikingly handsome man, who opened the door, with Han-Eul Hyung behind him. Are the two of them lovers? He wants to leave Han-Eul, who tells him to just go if he doesn't want to do it. But Geon-Woo, angry at the idea of Han-Eul spending the night with Ji-Ho instead of him, agrees to 3p...?!\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Peanutoon's Gosuwi BL Danpyeonseon (고수위 BL 단편선) Collection.*",
